<div id="container">
  <main>
    <section id="about">
      <h1 data-i18n="about.title">About me</h1>
      <p data-i18n="about.intro">Hi, my name is José Ivo and I'm a Information Technology undergraduate with
        emphasis in Computer Science at the Universidade Federal do Rio Grande do Norte.
        I'm currently working as a Jr. Artificial Intelligence Developer for HAIS TECH,
        and I'm part of a research group at IMD/UFRN focused on Deep Continuous Learning
        with Adaptive Resonance Theory Neural Networks. My main work/research interests
        consist of various AI and Machine Learning themes such as Continuous Reinforcement
        Learning, Uncertainty in AI and LLMs applied to the medical domain. I'm also interested
        in Linux and Unix-like systems and Back-end development. Currently, I'm searching to
        gather development experience on the job market, but I aim to follow an academic career,
        and I'm really interested in being a College Professor.</p>
      <figure class="image-caption-wrapper">
      <img src="assets/me_teaching.jpg" width="70%", height="70%"/>
      <figcaption data-i18n="about.caption">Me, teaching a freshman Data Science course, as a fellow PET-CC member, at DIMAP/UFRN (2025).</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <p data-i18n="about.experience">My work experience consists mostly on Python development for Machine Learning applications
         using practical frameworks such as FastAPI, LLM agents with Ollama, VLLM and Langchain, SQL 
         and NoSQL databases such as MongoDB and PostgreSQL and Machine Learning Ops. using Docker, W&B
        and GitLab/GitHub CI/CD pipelines. I also have some experience on Back-end development with
        Java using Spring Framework and some
         experience in Front-end development using Vue.JS and React.</p>
    </section>
